OL,3,GNEWSAScouts boss charged over missing
OL,4,ACanada trip funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Scouts boss has been charged
OL,7,Fwith fraud after about #200,000 raised
OL,8,Ftowards a children's summer trip to
OL,9,FNorth America went missing.
OL,11,FMore than 100 scouts from Herefordshire
OL,12,Fand Worcestershire saw their two-week
OL,13,Ftrip to Canada cancelled when the money
OL,14,Fwas removed from a charity account.
OL,16,FWest Mercia Police said 46-year-old
OL,17,FRobert Sidley, of Worcester, had been
OL,18,Fcharged with fraud by abuse of
OL,19,Fposition.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
